hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1680","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakrah se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qazi do ke darmiyan faisla na kare, ya do ke darmiyan hukm na kare jab woh gusse mein ho."
"1681","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Umair se, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakrah se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hakim do ke darmiyan hukm na kare, ya qazi do ke darmiyan faisla na kare jab woh gusse mein ho. Pehli Kitab Adabul Qazi se aur doosri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1682","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zyada apne sahaba se mashwara karne wala koi nahin dekha. Aur Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya: Aur un ka mamla un ke darmiyan mashware se hai (Ash-Shura: 38)."
"1683","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se: Umar logon ke sath sirf Abdur Rahman bin Auf ki hadees ki wajah se laute, yani jab woh Shaam ki taraf nikle, to unhein wahan taa'oon padne ki khabar mili."
"1684","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Ali se: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jab dawawin murattab kiye, to farmaya: Tumhari kya rae hai main kin se shuru karun? To un se kaha gaya: Apne qareeb phir qareeb se shuru karen. Unhon ne farmaya: Balke main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qareeb phir qareeb se shuru karunga. Pehli aur Shafi'i ke qaul Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, doosri Kitab Risalah se, aur teesri Kitab Qasamil Fai se, aur woh us mein aakhri hai."
"1685","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Hadh se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim Taimi se, Busr se, Abu Qais maula Amr bin Aas se, Amr bin Aas se: Unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab hakim hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir durust ho to us ke liye do ajr hain, aur jab hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir khata kare to us ke liye ek ajr hai."
"1686","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Hadh se, unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne yeh hadees Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm ko sunayi to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se aise hi hadees bayan ki."
"1687","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad bin Abi Ubaid Darawardi ne hamein khabar di, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Hadh se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Busr bin Sa'id se, Abu Qais maula Amr bin Aas se, Amr bin Aas se: Unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab hakim hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir durust ho to us ke liye do ajr hain, aur jab hukm kare aur ijtihad kare phir khata kare to us ke liye ek ajr hai."
"1688","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Hadh ne farmaya, phir main ne yeh hadees Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm ko sunayi to unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Abu Salamah ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se aise hi hadees bayan ki. Dono hadeesein Kitab Risalah se aur woh us mein aakhri hain, aur teesri aur chauthi Kitab Jima'ul Ilm se aur woh us mein jo hain."
"1689","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Zainab bint Abi Salamah se, Umm Salamah zauja Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main sirf ek bashar hun, aur tum mere paas jhagde late ho, aur shayad tum mein se koi apni hujjat bayan karne mein doosre se zyada tez-zaban ho, to main us ke liye us ke mutabiq faisla kar dun jo main us se sunun, phir jis ke liye main us ke bhai ke haq mein se kisi cheez ka faisla kar dun to woh use na le, kyunke main us ke liye aag ka tukda kaat raha hun."
"1690","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se, Zainab bint Abi Salamah se, Umm Salamah se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main sirf tumhari tarah ek bashar hun, aur tum mere paas jhagde late ho, phir shayad tum mein se koi apni hujjat bayan karne mein doosre se zyada tez-zaban ho, to main us ke liye us ke mutabiq faisla kar dun jo main us se sunun, phir jis ke liye main us ke bhai ke haq mein se kisi cheez ka faisla kar dun to woh us mein se na le kyunke main us ke liye aag ka tukda kaat raha hun. Pehli Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se aur doosri Kitab Ibtalul Istihsan se, aur woh us mein aakhri hadees hai."
"1691","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Haram bin Sa'd bin Muhaisah se: Bara bin Aazib ki oontni ek qaum ke bagh mein dakhil hui, aur us mein fasad kiya, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne amwal walon par din mein us ki hifazat ka faisla farmaya, aur jo maweshi raat ko fasad karen woh us ke ghar walon par zaamin hai."
"1692","[AI-translation] Ayyub bin Suwaid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Auza'i ne hamein hadees bayan ki, Zuhri se, Haram bin Muhaisah se, Bara bin Aazib (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Bara bin Aazib ki oontni Ansar mein se ek aadmi ke bagh mein dakhil hui, aur us mein fasad kiya, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne baghon walon par din mein hifazat ka aur maweshi walon par jo un ke maweshi raat ko fasad karen us ka faisla farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1693","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Daleel mudda'i par hai. Mera khayal hai unhon ne farmaya, aur main sabit nahin karta ke unhon ne farmaya: Aur qasam mudda'alaih par hai."
"1694","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Ishaq bin Abi Farwah se, Umar bin Hakam se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Do aadmi ek janwar ka dawa karte the, aur un mein se har ek ne daleel qayam ki ke woh us ka janwar hai jise us ne paida kiya, to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke haq mein faisla farmaya jis ke haath mein woh tha. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, aur doosri Kitab Da'wa wal Bayyinat se, aur woh us mein pehli hadees hai."
"1695","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Ulaiyah ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas se: Unhein apne ek bete mein shak hua, to unhon ne us ke liye qafah bulaya."
"1696","[AI-translation] Anas bin Iyaz ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se: Yahya bin Abdur Rahman bin Hatib se: Do aadmi ek ladke ka dawa karte the, to Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us ke liye qafah bulaya, to unhon ne kaha: Woh dono us mein shareek hain. To Umar ne us se farmaya: Un dono mein se jise tum chaho wali bana lo."
"1697","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Umar se usi mani ki tarah."
"1698","[AI-translation] Mutarrif bin Mazin ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Urwah bin Zubair se, Umar bin Khattab se usi mani ki tarah. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Da'wa wal Bayyinat se nikali."
"1699","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Suhail se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Sa'd ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, farmayen agar main apni biwi ke sath ek aadmi paun to kya main use mohlat dun yahan tak ke chaar gawah laye? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han."
"1700","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Sa'd ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, farmayen agar main apni biwi ke sath ek aadmi paun to kya main use mohlat dun yahan tak ke chaar gawah laaun? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han."
"1701","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Ibn Musayyab se: Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha gaya jo apni biwi ke sath doosre aadmi ko paye aur use qatl kar de ya use qatl kar de, unhon ne farmaya: Agar woh chaar gawah na laye to use poora supurd kar diya jaye."
"1702","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Shaam mein ek aadmi ne apni biwi ke sath ek aadmi paya aur use qatl kar diya ya use qatl kar diya, to Muawiyah ne Abu Musa Ash'ari ko likha ke woh us ke liye is bare mein Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se pooche. To unhon ne un se poocha, to Ali ne farmaya: Yeh aisi cheez hai jo Iraq ki zameen mein nahin, main tumhein qasam deta hun tum mujhe zaroor khabar doge, to unhon ne unhein khabar di. To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya, main Abul Hasan hun: Agar woh chaar gawah na laye to use poora supurd kar diya jaye. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se, doosri Kitab Adabul Qazi se, teesri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se, aur chauthi Kitab Janaiz se nikali."
"1703","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Zuhri ko kehte suna: Ahl Iraq ka khayal hai ke qazif ki gawahi jaiz nahin. To main gawahi deta hun, mujhe Sa'id bin Musayyab ne khabar di: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Bakrah se farmaya: Tauba kar lo, tumhari gawahi qubool ki jayegi, ya agar tum tauba karo to tumhari gawahi qubool ki jayegi. Aur main ne Sufyan bin Uyainah ko ise aise kai baar hadees bayan karte suna phir main ne unhein kehte suna: Mujhe is mein shak hua. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun, mujhe fulan ne khabar di, phir unhon ne ek aadmi ka naam liya aur mujhe us ka naam yaad na raha, to main ne poocha, Umar bin Qais ne mujh se kaha: Woh Sa'id bin Musayyab se hai. Aur Sufyan ko shak na tha ke woh Sa'id bin Musayyab hain. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur un ke siva Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Umar se riwayat karte hain."
"1704","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Zuhri ne khabar di. Phir jab main khada hua to main ne poocha, to Umar bin Qais ne, jo mere sath majlis mein hazir the, mujh se kaha: Woh Sa'id bin Musayyab hain (Raziyallahu anhu). Main ne Sufyan se kaha: Kya tumhein shak hua jab Sa'id bin Musayyab ne tumhein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, woh jaisa unhon ne farmaya, magar mujhe shak aa gaya tha."
"1705","[AI-translation] Mujhe Madinah walon mein se us ne khabar di jis par mujhe bharosa hai, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jab teenon ko kode lagaye, to un se tauba karayi. Phir do laut aaye aur unhon ne un dono ki gawahi qubool ki, aur Abu Bakrah ne lautne se inkar kiya to unhon ne un ki gawahi radd kar di. Yeh teenon hadeesein aur Shafi'i ke qaul Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se nikali."
"1706","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se: Unhon ne aurton ke mamle mein se kisi cheez par aurton ki gawahi ke bare mein farmaya: Us mein chaar se kam jaiz nahin."
"1707","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se ke unhon ne farmaya: Aurton ki gawahi jaiz nahin, un ke sath koi mard na ho, aurton ke mamle mein chaar adil se kam."
"1708","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, bachon ki gawahi ke bare mein: Jaiz nahin. Aur Ibn Juraij ne Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, Ibn Abbas se izafa kiya; kyunke Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Un mein se jinhein tum gawahon mein se pasand karo (Al-Baqarah: 282). Pehli Kitab Da'wa wal Bayyinat se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Ahkamul Quran se nikali."
"1709","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Abdullah bin Haris bin Abdul Malik Makhzoomi ne hamein khabar di, Saif bin Sulaiman Makki se, Qais bin Sa'd se, Amr bin Dinar se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya. Amr ne farmaya: Amwal mein."
"1710","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Rabi'ah bin Usman se, Mu'az bin Abdur Rahman se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se aur ek doosre aadmi se jis ka us ne naam liya, to mujhe us ke naam ka zikr yaad nahin, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya."
"1711","[AI-translation] Ibrahim ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Abi Amr maula Muttalib se, Ibn Musayyab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya."
"1712","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad bin Abi Ubaid Darawardi ne hamein khabar di, Rabi'ah bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, Sa'id bin Amr bin Shurahbil bin Sa'id bin Sa'd bin Ubadah se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Sa'd ki kitabon mein paya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya."
"1713","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur Abdul Aziz bin Abdul Muttalib ne Sa'id bin Amr se zikr kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Sa'd bin Ubadah ki kitabon mein paya, Sa'd bin Ubadah gawahi dete hain: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ko hukm diya ke woh qasam ke sath gawah par faisla kare."
"1714","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Rabi'ah bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, Suhail bin Abi Salih se, apne walid se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya. Abdul Aziz ne farmaya: Phir main ne yeh Suhail se zikr kiya. Unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Rabi'ah ne khabar di, aur woh mere nazdeek siqah hai, ke main ne use yeh hadees bayan ki thi, aur mujhe yaad nahin. Abdul Aziz ne farmaya: Suhail ko beemari lag gayi thi jis ne un ke baaz hifz ko pahunchi aur woh apni baaz hadees bhool gaye, phir Suhail us ke baad use Rabi'ah se, us se, apne walid se hadees bayan karte the."
"1715","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya."
"1716","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ja'far bin Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Hakam bin Utaibah ko apne walid se poochte suna, aur unhon ne khade hone ke liye qabr ki deewar par haath rakha tha: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya? Unhon ne farmaya: Han, aur Ali ne tumhare darmiyan faisla farmaya. Muslim ne farmaya: Ja'far ne farmaya: Qarz mein."
"1717","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Amr bin Shuaib se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne gawahi ke bare mein farmaya: Agar woh gawah laye to gawah ke sath qasam khaye."
"1718","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Khalid bin Abi Karimah se, Abu Ja'far se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya."
"1719","[AI-translation] Shafi'i: Unhon ne apne baaz munazir se farmaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne un se kaha: Saqafi ne, aur woh siqah hain, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Jabir se riwayat ki: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam ke sath gawah par faisla farmaya. Yeh das hadeesein Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se, aur woh us mein sab se pehli hain, aur gyarahwin Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se aur woh us mein aakhri hai."
"1720","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hashim bin Hashim bin Utbah bin Abi Waqqas se, Abdullah bin Nistas se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mere is mimbar par gunah wali qasam khaye, woh apna thikana aag mein bana le."
"1721","[AI-translation] Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Dawood bin Husain se: Unhon ne Abu Ghatfan Murri ko kehte suna: Zaid bin Sabit aur Ibn Muti' ne Marwan bin Hakam ke paas ek ghar mein jhagda kiya. To us ne Zaid bin Sabit par mimbar par qasam ka faisla farmaya. To Zaid ne farmaya: Main us ke liye apni jagah qasam khaunga. Marwan ne farmaya: Nahin, Allah ki qasam! Magar huqooq ke faisle ki jagaon par, phir Zaid qasam khane lage ke un ka haq haq hai, aur mimbar par qasam khane se inkar karte rahe, to Marwan is par ta'ajjub karne lage. Malik ne farmaya: Zaid ne zabardasti ki qasam ko napasand kiya."
"1722","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muammal ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Mulaikah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Taif se Ibn Abbas ko do laundiyon ke bare mein likha jin mein se ek ne doosri ko mara, aur un par koi gawah na tha, to unhon ne mujhe likha ke un dono ko Asr ke baad roko, phir un par padho: Jo Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon ke badle thodi qeemat khareedte hain (Aal Imran: 77). To main ne aisa kiya, aur us ne iqrar kar liya. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Yameen ma' Shahid se nikali."
"1723","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Amr aur Ibn Juraij ne Ata se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne farmaya: Main gaya, main aur Ubaid bin Umair, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas, jab woh Sabir mein e'tikaf mein thin. To main ne un se Allah Azza wa Jalla ke farman ke bare mein poocha: Allah tumhein tumhari qasmon mein laghw par nahin pakdega (Al-Baqarah: 225). Unhon ne farmaya: Woh hai: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, han, Allah ki qasam."
"1724","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se ke unhon ne farmaya: Laghw qasam insan ka qaul hai: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, aur han, Allah ki qasam."
"1725","[AI-translation] Aur Ibn Umar se ke unhon ne farmaya: Jo kisi qasam par qasam khaye phir use pukhta kare to us par gardan aazad karna hai. Pehli Kitab Kaffarat wan Nuzoor se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhuma) mein nikali."
